# Reserved for Azure Machine Configuration custom audit packages.
#
# Per `specs/001-azure-stig-dashboard/plan.md` and `tasks.md` (T225), this
# folder will host:
#   - windows-stig/   (PowerSTIG/Evaluate-STIG audit-only DSC composite)
#   - linux-stig/     (Evaluate-STIG Linux wrapper)
#   - build/          (signed-package build pipeline targeting ACR)
#
# Packages are produced via Guest Configuration tooling and published to a
# storage account or container registry referenced by Azure Policy
# assignments in `infra/modules/policy.bicep`.
